# Visual-regression baselines under Snapshots/linux-chromium/ ARE committed —
# the containerized Playwright .NET image unifies the execution environment,
# so canonical Linux-Chromium baselines apply equally to every dev machine and
# to CI. Diff/actual PNGs from test runs stay untracked.

# Diff/actual/expected outputs written by PageSnapshotExtensions on failure:
/Snapshots/**/*.diff.png
/Snapshots/**/*.actual.png
/Snapshots/**/*.expected.png
/Snapshots/diffs/
/Snapshots/failures/**.png

# Any non-canonical baseline directory (e.g. baselines accidentally generated
# outside the container on Windows/macOS native) — keep untracked so they
# can't drift the canonical set:
/Snapshots/windows-chromium/
/Snapshots/macos-chromium/
